    "A GitHub repository holding one folder per extension, laid out like raycast/extensions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个 GitHub 仓库，每个扩展对应一个文件夹，结构与 raycast/extensions 相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A folder holding package.json and the built command files." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "包含 package.json 和已构建命令文件的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A key is already stored in Keychain" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "钥匙串中已存储密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pattern without a slash matches any file or folder name, like *.tmp or node_modules; one with a slash matches the whole path, like **/[Cc]ache/**. The built-in patterns always apply." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不含斜杠的规则会匹配任意文件或文件夹名，例如 *.tmp 或 node_modules；含斜杠的规则会匹配完整路径，例如 **/[Cc]ache/**。内置规则始终生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A repository with one folder per extension, laid out like raycast/extensions. These serve source, so installing one builds it here — dependencies first, with the package manager above. Add a registry only if you trust who publishes it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仓库中每个扩展对应一个文件夹，结构与 raycast/extensions 相同。这些注册源提供源码，安装时会先使用上方的包管理器安装依赖，再在本机构建。请仅添加你信任的发布者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A shortcut works even when its command is hidden from the launcher." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即使命令在启动器中隐藏，快捷键仍然有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tiny, native macOS launcher." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一款小巧的原生 macOS 启动器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
